# A window made larger by its sizing corner is drawn to its new edges (design 10.1), for
# tools/ui_run.py. 原紙集め (a process: 仮身一覧's code, its window at 660,40 to 880,528, the
# corner at 870,518) is carried by the corner to 1060,700 in steps: the work area (670,69 to
# 1052,692) is white to the right and the foot, where it grew. A program narrows what may be
# drawn for a piece of its drawing and puts back what it found; the size changing meanwhile
# must not leave it drawing within the old size for good (dp_set_place). Made smaller, and
# 全画面表示 by a double press on the corner and back, it is drawn as well. The same for
# 基本文章編集 running as a process (pdoc) and for the desktop's own window BTRON. (Closing
# 原紙集め is refused a right on its object, !OACV!, apart from this: looked for before.)
waitwin 原紙箱
open 01a0d8c4-5b92-7c53-8d64-9fab0c1d5b92
waitwin 原紙集め
expect basecol: up
wait 1000
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 880 528
logmark
drag 870 518 1060 700
expectsince basecol: 16 templates in 6 rows 382 wide
wait 1500
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 1070 710
shot pg_grown
pixel 1000 600 FFFFFF
pixel 1048 688 FFFFFF
pixel 1048 300 FFFFFF
pixel 674 688 FFFFFF
# drawn by the program, not only laid white: the frame of ブラウザ's link, laid out at the new width
pixel 1015 103 000000
pixel 1022 112 000000
# smaller again
logmark
drag 1060 700 820 420
expectsince basecol: drew
wait 1500
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 830 430
shot pg_small
pixel 800 400 FFFFFF
# larger in one step
logmark
drag 820 420 1000 650
expectsince basecol: drew
wait 1500
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 1010 660
pixel 988 640 FFFFFF
# 全画面表示 by a double press on the corner, and back
logmark
dclick 1000 650
expectsince basecol: drew
wait 1500
shot pg_full
pixel 1250 740 FFFFFF
pixel 30 740 FFFFFF
logmark
dclick 1270 770
expectsince basecol: drew
wait 1500
win 原紙集め
want ok 660 40 1010 660
shot pg_back
pixel 988 640 FFFFFF
absent !OACV!
key 08 01
wait 800
# 基本文章編集 as a process: its window at 100,100 600x400, the corner at 690,490
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 690 490 900 680
expectsince document: drew
wait 1500
shot pg_doc
pixelnot 880 660 000000
pixelnot 880 200 000000
pixelnot 200 660 000000
key 08 01
expect document: closed
wait 800
# the desktop's own window BTRON, at 0,0 to 350,226, the corner at 340,216
win BTRON
want ok 0 0 350 226
click 100 12
wait 300
drag 340 216 520 420
wait 1500
win BTRON
want ok 0 0 530 430
shot pg_btron
pixelnot 500 400 000000
pixelnot 500 40 000000
pixelnot 20 400 000000
drag 520 420 340 216
wait 1000
win BTRON
want ok 0 0 350 226
